      "title": "Co-spread: Sxy",
      "file": "stats.py",
      "line": 31,
      "anchor": "return total",
      "text": "For each point we measure how far it is from the centroid, dx = x − 3 and dy = y − 4, and add up dx·dy:\n\n- (1,2): (−2)(−2) = 4\n- (2,4): (−1)(0) = 0\n- (3,5): (0)(1) = 0\n- (4,4): (1)(0) = 0\n- (5,5): (2)(1) = 2\n\n**Sxy = 6**. It is positive, so y tends to go up when x goes up.",
